From e1e9bceee821814625602b968afd0866fd1ef8a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bluseliu50 <265648257+bluseliu50@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 16:27:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] build: WLAN + Bluetooth milestone (milestone-btwlan-1) (#17)

Build orchestration for the WLAN/Bluetooth milestone.

- build-test-image.sh stages the Peach WLAN firmware under the names
  ath12k expects (ath12k/PEACH/hw2.0, board data bd_p81.elf,
  regdb_xiaomi.bin), the Brahma BT firmware and the PERI patch/NVM
  (brhperifw20.tlv, brhperinv20.bin), and builds the piano-bt-scan helper
- submodules: linux-piano c7626aaf3 (piano-7.2.6, #12), debian-piano
  a30c83f (main, #16)

Tested on the device (image kernel 7.2.6-00046-g223d75c045cc): WLAN 2.4 +
5 GHz scan; Bluetooth up at 8 Mbaud and stable. The tested pre-merge
commits carry the milestone-btwlan-1 tags.
---
 debian-piano                |  2 +-
 linux-piano                 |  2 +-
 scripts/build-test-image.sh | 98 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 3 files changed, 83 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

